{"bill": "SB270", "session_code": "20261", "version_id": 266936, "version_label": "Conference Report", "draft_date": "2026-03-12T18:37:00", "text": "<p class=textbl>JOINT CONFERENCE COMMITTEE REPORT</p> <p></p> <p class=textbl>We, the conferees, appointed by the respective bodies to consider and report upon the disagreeing vote on <strong>Senate Bill No. 270</strong>, report as follows:</p> <p class=textbl>A. We recommend that the House Amendment in the Nature of a Substitute (26108534D) be rejected.</p> <p class=textbl>B. We recommend that the attached Amendment in the Nature of a Substitute (26109767D) be accepted to resolve the matter under disagreement.</p> <table align=center cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\"> <tr> <td style=\"PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 9.35pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 9.35pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Respectfully submitted,</p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Schuyler T. VanValkenburg (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Barbara A. Favola (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric> </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric></p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric>Senator Bryce E. Reeves (signed) </p> <p class=MsoNormal style=LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideogra